%% Sequence 3: a mechanic finishes a work item from the tablet.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Mech as Mechanic
  participant Tablet
  participant Shell as JavaFX shell
  participant API
  participant Kernel
  participant Store as Storage
  participant Bus as Event bus
  participant TgPlugin as Telegram plugin
  participant Telegram

  Mech->>Tablet: "Done" on a work item
  Tablet->>API: POST /items/{id}/finish
  API->>Kernel: finishWorkItem
  Kernel->>Store: work item -> Done, history
  opt all work items done
    Kernel->>Store: order -> Ready
  end
  Kernel->>Bus: WorkItemFinished, OrderReady (after commit)
  Bus->>Shell: refresh the order board
  Bus->>API: broadcast
  API-->>Tablet: WebSocket update
  Bus->>TgPlugin: OrderReady
  TgPlugin->>Telegram: "Your bike is ready"
  Note over Kernel,Store: Kernel steps run in one transaction, events leave only after commit.
